LAME usage guidance -- NetPi documentation update 2026-10-11

LAME may be used in commercial programs under the applicable GNU Library
General Public License terms. COPYING contains the complete version 2 license
text. Source-file notices specify whether version 2 or a later version applies.
This guidance does not replace those terms.

Preserve the copyright, license and warranty notices. Distributing modified
versions also requires the modification notices and other conditions described
in COPYING, including the date of changes. Distribution of an application with
the library is addressed in sections 5 and 6; linking the library separately
does not by itself satisfy every distribution condition.

Acknowledge LAME and its upstream project at https://lame.sourceforge.io/.
Contributing fixes to the upstream maintainers is encouraged. That invitation
is voluntary and separate from the distribution conditions in COPYING.

New NetPi scripts, tests and maintained documentation in this repository are
provided under LGPL-2.0-or-later. Existing upstream and third-party license
notices are retained. The original upstream usage guidance is preserved in
doc/upstream/LICENSE as historical reference. The full license text in COPYING
has not been changed.
